AppNeta Intelligent Alarm ({S 304}) - {S 306} on item {S 308}

SYMPTOMS:

An AppNeta Intelligent Alarms ConnectError rule was triggered, indicating the monitoring
point could not establish or maintain a connection to the monitored target.

PROBABLE CAUSES:

Network connectivity failure, target unreachable, firewall/ACL blocking, or the monitored
service being down, as determined by AppNeta's own monitoring criteria for this rule.

RECOMMENDED ACTIONS:

Review this alarm's details in AppNeta's Intelligent Alarms console to determine root cause.
This alarm clears automatically when AppNeta reports the underlying condition resolved.
